# Holds artifacts produced by ML scripts (e.g. synthetic_overlay.png from
# `services/ml/scripts/validate_synthetic_v2.py`). Streamed by
# `MlStatusController#syntheticOverlay` at GET /api/admin/ml-status/synthetic-overlay.png.
#
# Generated files are not checked in; this .gitkeep just preserves the
# directory so the controller's stat() check has a stable parent at boot.
